    "title": "8月信息更新",
    "category": 1,
    "header": "",
    "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\"><strong>·8月更新内容前瞻</strong></span></span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\" id=\"173\" alt=\"1 封面.png\" title=\"1 封面.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/_staging/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20250610/72e1437ac8023d903fcc98a351974558.png\"/></div><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><strong><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">·游览者列表</span></strong></span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\" id=\"186\" alt=\"2 月度(2).png\" title=\"2 月度(2).png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/_staging/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20250610/91633359b8604dbb5e7da9ae951def00.png\"/></div><p></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">界园游客 年</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">当年顺手送出的礼，竟换来了回礼。为“人”之道，还挺有意思。</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><strong><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">·游园纪念</span></strong></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\" id=\"175\" alt=\"3 奖励.png\" title=\"3 奖励.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/_staging/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20250610/16163eb9e3f7a253b63e5882079c54b2.png\"/></div><p></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">游园纪念添加内容</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">游园纪念的等级上限提升至</span><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">65</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">。</span></span></p><p></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">8月稀有奖励 高级资深干员技巧集</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">全面详实地记载了专家级技艺的集录，干员经过学习操练，可以快速积累经验，达到专家级的认定标准。</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><strong><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">·本月委托栏</span></strong></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">本月委托栏将会覆盖一批委托。委托更新后，上月的委托进度将不会被继承。</span></span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">您将获得可在本月使用的四次刷新未完成委托的机会。点击刷新后，即可重新获得同等级的委托。</span></span></span></p>",
